1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:09,230
♪La la la la la la, la la la la la la♪

2
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,740
♪La la la la la la la la la♪

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,330
♪No matter what day it is,
I'll spend it with you♪

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:19,100
♪We're more sure
of each other than ever♪

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,060
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

6
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,500
(Heartbeats)

7
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:28,720
Let's do it.

8
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,500
(Familiar faces are here)

9
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,760
Grab a seat, everyone.

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Okay.

11
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,320
Let's start

12
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,240
with some introductions.

13
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,400
(Ladies first)
Let's start with the ladies.

14
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,720
(Wang Yifan, Season 8 Guest)
Hi,

15
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:40,240
I'm an old friend of Heart Signal.

16
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,200
I'm Yifan.

17
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,400
(Li Dinghao, Season 7 Guest)
Hi,

18
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,320
I'm Li Dinghao from Season 7.

19
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,700
(Sun Jingjun, Season 6 Guest)
Hi,

20
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,800
I'm from Season 6,

21
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,800
Sun Jingjun. You can call me Sun.

22
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:49,920
Welcome.

23
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,520
How many watch parties have you done?

24
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,380
(Quietly)

25
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,000
This is my first.

26
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,640
(Newbie)
Your first one?

27
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:55,960
Yeah.

28
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,360
Last time,

29
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,120
the watch party

30
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:01,200
conflicted with my work.

31
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,040
So, I was really excited coming in.

32
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:06,720
It feels like getting an early preview.

33
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,520
Yeah, I'm really happy.

34
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,360
And I'm curious what this cast is like.

35
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:12,380
(Can't wait)

36
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,920
I've watched my own season before,

37
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,360
(Semi-newbie)
but never someone else's.

38
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:18,360
Then I guess I've done this the most.

39
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:21,280
I watched our season,

40
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,840
your season,

41
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,400
and counting today,

42
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,920
this is my third time.

43
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:26,740
(Mm)

44
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,900
(Mm-hmm)

45
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:28,660
(Mm)

46
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:29,100
Yeah.

47
00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,100
(What do I say?)

48
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,440
This is actually my first time...

49
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,320
New friends.

50
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,320
(New friends)
Watching Heart Signal

51
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:38,840
(Looks left)
with new friends.

52
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,440
(Looks right)
I was a little nervous coming in,

53
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:42,680
(Looks left)
but once we met, it felt fine.

54
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,520
Pretty relaxed.

55
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,600
I'm still nervous.

56
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:46,660
(Teasing)
You're still nervous?

57
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,200
Okay, then let's...

58
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:52,540
(Mm-hmm)

59
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,440
Every season starts

60
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,880
with a different personality test.

61
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,160
On our season,

62
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,480
it was a food test.

63
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,960
Mine was luosifen.

64
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,760
Luosifen?

65
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,240
It's kind of abstract.

66
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,040
What?

67
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,760
Your season had...

68
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,120
The travel personality test.

69
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,480
Right.

70
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,640
And I got the Responsible Type.

71
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:10,100
(Responsible Type)

72
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:11,960
What was yours, Jingjun?

73
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,200
Ours was animals.

74
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,400
(Animals)
Animal? What animal were you?

75
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,120
A little leopard.

76
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:15,880
A leopard?

77
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,240
What does that mean?

78
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,240
(Fierce)
I guess... pretty fierce?

79
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,440
Are you fierce?

80
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,480
Maybe I wanted to be a...

81
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,920
Do you think it fits you?

82
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,680
I think...

83
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,520
the choice I made then

84
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,280
probably reflected

85
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,960
who I was at the time.

86
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,280
If you took the same test now,

87
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,720
do you think

88
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,120
you'd get the same result?

89
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,080
Maybe not.

90
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,480
It's been two years, after all.

91
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,920
Only one year for me.

92
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,960
Mine might be the same.

93
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,560
Okay.

94
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:43,800
Let's see.

95
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,040
This season's test

96
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,240
is about what kind of love you want.

97
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,080
(Your ideal kind of love)
There are four types.

98
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,440
Lucky them.

99
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,280
Only four choices.

100
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:50,600
(Laughs)

101
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:51,040
Yeah.

102
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,600
Seriously.

103
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:52,400
For me,

104
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,360
multiple-choice questions

105
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,440
are always hard.

106
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,840
(Decision paralysis)
I'm a Libra, after all.

107
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,840
(Fellow air sign)
I'm an air sign too.

108
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,480
And I overthink everything too.

109
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,320
(Same struggle)
You do too?

110
00:02:59,320 --> 00:02:59,760
Yeah.

111
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,760
I'm a Gemini.

112
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,760
(Air signs x3)
I'm a Gemini too.

113
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,920
(What are the odds?)
You're a Gemini too?

114
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:04,360
(Want them all)
I'd want all of them.

115
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,960
(Must pick one)
But we have to choose one.

116
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:11,580
(Not a freeze-frame)

117
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,840
I'm so torn.

118
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,800
Really?

119
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,280
(Want them all)
They all matter.

120
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:15,640
I think...

121
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,840
Let me see the blue one.

122
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,640
If this were back then,

123
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,560
I would've picked...

124
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,440
this one.

125
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,200
(2023 Sun Jingjun: Passionate Love)

126
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,640
That feels very "little leopard".

127
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,320
Now I'd pick this.

128
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,920
(2023: Passionate Sun Jingjun)
Empathetic Love.

129
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,860
(2026: Empathetic Sun Jingjun)

130
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,680
(Empathetic Love)
I chose Empathetic Love.

131
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,280
It says I want two people

132
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,360
to flow side by side, like two streams.

133
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,680
When you're tired, silence is okay.

134
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,360
When you're happy,

135
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,880
you celebrate together.

136
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,720
I think if two people

137
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:43,360
can sit in silence

138
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,280
and still feel totally comfortable,

139
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,760
that's a really good sign.

140
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:46,160
Exactly.

141
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,240
I picked

142
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,160
the green one.

143
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,200
I think it fits

144
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,920
where I am right now.

145
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:56,680
I've lived alone since college,

146
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,680
so I'm used to being on my own.

147
00:03:57,680 --> 00:04:00,120
And I think

148
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,440
having a strong sense of independence

149
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,240
is really important.

150
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,080
Yeah.

151
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,720
Right?

152
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,960
So does that mean

153
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,840
when you're in a relationship,

154
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,640
you need a lot of space?

155
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,320
There are definitely times

156
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,920
when I need to be alone

157
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,360
to process things.

158
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,560
But what matters more to me

159
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,800
is being whole as your own person first.

160
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,560
When something happens,

161
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,960
you should first be able
to handle it yourself.

162
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,720
Then when two independent people
come together,

163
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,560
one plus one becomes more than two.

164
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,320
So to me,

165
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,880
you have to be whole on your own first,

166
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:33,120
(Stand on your own before you love)
then build a relationship together.

167
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,920
Okay, you've convinced me.

168
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,320
But for me, personality-wise,

169
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,560
when something really happens,

170
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,400
I handle it myself.

171
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,360
I'm not really the type

172
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,600
to tell my partner

173
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,320
about problems I can't solve.

174
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,840
At most, after I've handled it,

175
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,800
I'll vent about it.

176
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,040
But I wouldn't make them

177
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,360
carry it with me.

178
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,080
So when things get hard,
you deal with it yourself.

179
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,520
Yeah, I think...

180
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,280
First,

181
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,880
you need

182
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,520
to be able to solve your own problems.

183
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,000
But sometimes,

184
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,840
for me

185
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:04,320
to show you that I need you,

186
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,520
I might want you

187
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,440
to help me work through my problems.

188
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,840
I think that's totally fair.

189
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,560
Relationships

190
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,360
are so emotional.

191
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,480
There isn't really...

192
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,280
A hard rule for any of it.

193
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:17,920
Right.

194
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:21,680
I just noticed

195
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,920
there's a map on the back.

196
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,880
Are the maps different?

197
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,480
I'm wondering...

198
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,160
(Just a guess)
if they're different locations.

199
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,000
Look.

200
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,840
Blue is here.

201
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:31,360
Yellow.

202
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,960
Green.

203
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:32,880
Yeah.

204
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:35,160
Maybe there are four different
meeting spots.

205
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:35,560
Okay.

206
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,760
Let's keep that curiosity going

207
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,760
and meet this season's new cast.

208
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:40,680
(Excited to meet them)
Okay.

209
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:42,400
I'd just ask him,

210
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,670
do you like me?

211
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:45,570
Between two people,

212
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:46,950
a lot of things
can just be said directly.

213
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,470
That way,

214
00:05:47,470 --> 00:05:49,250
there's a lot less guessing.

215
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:51,770
(Courage)
Take the initiative and step toward her.

216
00:05:51,770 --> 00:05:52,370
Hold on tight

217
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:54,920
(to the person I like.)
Feels like this could get interesting.

218
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:55,970
(Do something crazy)

219
00:05:55,970 --> 00:05:56,850
In relationships,

220
00:05:56,850 --> 00:05:58,060
I'm pretty straightforward.

221
00:05:58,210 --> 00:05:58,960
I'm very clear
about what I like and don't.

222
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:02,220
(Bold and direct)

223
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,360
Bold and direct.

224
00:06:04,330 --> 00:06:05,410
(Choose the love you want most)
Oh, this is a fun surprise.

225
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,740
They're choosing the kind
of love they want most.

226
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:08,920
(Red)
Passionate Love.

227
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,420
Honestly, I kind of want all of them.

228
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,700
I want them all.

229
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,400
(Let me see.)
Everyone wants them all.

230
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:18,890
What I want in love is sincerity.

231
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:19,790
That sense of security

232
00:06:19,790 --> 00:06:22,020
lets me show my most vulnerable side.

233
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:23,050
(Love means giving your whole self)

234
00:06:23,050 --> 00:06:25,000
Love at first sight is attraction.

235
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:27,050
(Love grows over time)
Real love comes with time.

236
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,360
That makes so much sense.

237
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,370
I need that unforgettable first spark.

238
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,600
A wishing fountain.

239
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:32,760
That's quite ceremonial.

240
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:36,860
(Passionate Space, Empathetic Space)

241
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:38,020
(Independent Space, Secure Space)

242
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,860
(The four Love Spaces are now open)

243
00:06:39,880 --> 00:06:41,640
So there are four spaces.

244
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,520
Do people who choose the same color

245
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,720
go to the same space?

246
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,320
That's how I read it.

247
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,400
I think so.

248
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,600
Then I guess

249
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,360
the first people they meet

250
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:50,480
will probably be kinda like them

251
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,760
or at least think like them.

252
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,400
Yeah.

253
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:59,480
(Arrived)
This must be where they meet.

254
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,680
It's not the house yet.

255
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:01,720
Right.

256
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,860
(Cui Kaiyi, Secure Love)

257
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:05,440
She picked

258
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:05,920
the yellow

259
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,520
card.

260
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,160
I'll sit...

261
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:08,400
I'll sit here.

262
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,680
You can tell she's a little nervous.

263
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:11,960
Just like our first time.

264
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,520
Yeah, same as us.

265
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:14,080
Right.

266
00:07:16,530 --> 00:07:17,000
Yeah.

267
00:07:17,890 --> 00:07:18,860
This is where I sit, right?

268
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,360
Trying to smile through the awkwardness.

269
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,520
When you're alone,

270
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,840
you start talking to yourself

271
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,250
to make it less awkward.

272
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:26,980
No way.

273
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,720
That's adorable.

274
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,600
So cute.

275
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,280
When you first entered the house,

276
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,640
what order did you go in?

277
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,080
I came in pretty late.

278
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,200
I think I was third.

279
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,040
So when you got in,

280
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,680
there were already people
to introduce you around?

281
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,400
Yeah. I think the first person
has it the hardest.

282
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,840
We'd already met
before entering the house,

283
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,800
when we first met on the island.

284
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,440
Right.

285
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,560
So on day one in the house,

